+nearest command by doubled horizontal bbox-centre distance (strict comparison,
+so ties retain the earlier/left command).  Codes are `1=rotate-cw`,
+`2=rotate-180`, `3=flip-lr`, `4=flip-ud`.  Tight transformed crops are sorted by
+nonzero cell count descending and minimum nonzero colour ascending, then packed
+from row 1, column 0 with one blank column between crops.
